@startuml
title edits — algorithm
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Read command and validate arguments;
if (Command syntax valid?) then (yes)
if (Any edits?) then (yes)
:Display edits in insertion order with location and iteration;
else (no)
:Display no edits;
endif
:Keep state and cache, do not invoke Vector;
else (no)
:Display command error, keep current state;
endif
stop
